E7 — conjecture mining and theorem-schema discovery

1. Repeated-sandwich fibre-gap schema
  (a,b)=(1,1) -> pattern 212
  (a,b)=(1,2) -> pattern 2122
  (a,b)=(2,1) -> pattern 2212
  (a,b)=(2,2) -> pattern 22122
  structural law: 2^a 1 2^b occurs iff a lower-valued entry lies
  in a repeated-value gap with >=a copies to its left and >=b to its right.
  exhaustive test coverage: all Cayley words through n=6 (unit suite).

